xecution for days before playing online is not needed for this game. Go straight to the fun playing the mind game of fighting games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/230d7d787c78aed32d4dee3b6a050e99.poster.avif?t=1770216884\" width=610 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/230d7d787c78aed32d4dee3b6a050e99.webm?t=1770216884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/230d7d787c78aed32d4dee3b6a050e99.mp4?t=1770216884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cross the goal and win the match!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat</strong> your opponent, <strong>run</strong> fast as possible and <strong>cross the goal</strong> at the end of the stage to win the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/b06fe45afc5092f77e2d7233d7cdffd6.poster.avif?t=1770216884\" width=608 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/b06fe45afc5092f77e2d7233d7cdffd6.webm?t=1770216884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/extras/b06fe45afc5092f77e2d7233d7cdffd6.mp4?t=1770216884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn fighting game concepts by playing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't know what cross-counter, priority, or cross-up hits are? Don't worry! The game will show you them as they happen, and you'll learn by playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rollback netcode ensures a responsive low latency gameplay experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planned Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: An amazing single-player experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer:</strong>\u00a0Battle against your friends on the same couch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Playable Characters</strong>\u00a0across\u00a0<strong>3 Unique Factions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 Stages</strong>\u00a0designed for intense battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ Terrains\u00a0</strong>offering diverse strategic gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rollback Netcode Multiplayer</strong>\u00a0for smooth, cross-platform online play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned for updates as we bring this vision to life!</p>","developers":["Yaga Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829140/f9d41f757866aa4a21d2a18cadea693fe1ed0de7/header.jpg?t=1770216884","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual-Core Duo 2.6GHz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX 10.13 or superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available sp